   "page": 10,
   "description": "One channel is pulsed from a 50 Ω pulse generator while its output switches an inductive load of 2 mH in series with 200 Ω from VS. A 1N3064 diode across the load returns the coil current; CL loads the output. COM is open. After switching, the output must recover to at least VS – 500 mV with VS = 50 V and IO = 300 mA.",
